or, PIG-A, CD55/CD59, complement inhibition\n2618:- The observed PNH query attached `FDA-Integrated Review.pdf` from the local CFB/iptacopan evidence folder and framed RBC clone size as biology/exploratory pharmacodynamics rather than a direct short-term CFB efficacy endpoint. Reopen the source PDFs and independently verify the question-specific interpretation before using it clinically. [Task 3] [chronicle memory]\n3027:- workflow_test_20260628, DeepSeek V4 Pro, hermes --provider deepseek --model deepseek-v4-pro, DeepSeek V4 Pro oneshot OK, enrollment-review-app, mg-k10-sar-mini, pnh-mini, CONTEXT.md, hermes_round1_sample_audit.md\n3377:- extensions/chronicle/resources/2026-07-26T08-07-00-nvcy-10min-memory-summary.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/康哲项目资料/AI/医学经理工作台/implementation/workbench, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/memories/extensions/chronicle/resources/2026-07-26T08-07-00-nvcy-10min-memory-summary.md, updated_at=2026-07-26T08:07:00+00:00, thread_id=None, PNH v16/v17 evidence and offline navigator review) [chronicle memory]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
