true\\\\n    requires_key_or_registration: true\\\\n    rationale_zh: 目标适应症中有结果的 II/III 期关键或注册相关干预性试验进入核心层。\\\\n  - rule_id: core_c_phase_ii_iii\\\\n    role: core\\\\n    priority: 80\\\\n    report_kinds: [C]\\\\n    indication_relations: [target]\\\\n    phases: [phase_ii, phase_ii_iii, phase_iii]\\\\n    design_categories: [interventional]\\\\n    requires_key_or_registration: true\\\\n    rationale_zh: 目标适应症中关键或注册相关的 II/III 期干预性试验进入设计核心层。\\\\n  - rule_id: c_early_decision_domain\\\\n    role: core\\\\n    priority: 80\\\\n    report_kinds: [C]\\\\n    indication_relations: [target]\\\\n    phases: [phase_i, phase_i_ii, early]\\\\n    design_categories: [interventional]\\\\n    excluded_development_contexts: [rare_disease, oncology, accelerated_development]\\\\n    requires_decision_domain: true\\\\n    required_decision_domains:\\\\n      - dose\\\\n      - endpoint\\\\n      - adaptive_design\\\\n      - population\\\\n      - estimand\\\\n      - registration_logic\\\\n    requires_specific_rationale: true\\\\n    rationale_zh: C 类早期试验只有明确关联剂量、终点、适应性设计、人群、estimand 或注册逻辑时进入设计核心层。\\\\n  - rule_id: support_named_problem\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    priority: 60\\\\n    report_kinds: [B, C]\\\\n    requires_named_issue: true\\\\n    required_problem_domains: [safety, regulatory, special_population]\\\\n    requires_irreplaceable_evidence: true\\\\n    requires_specific_rationale: true\\\\n    rationale_zh: 仅在已命名安全性、监管或特殊人群问题且核心层无法替代时进入支持层。\\\\n  - rule_id: exclude_healthy_volunteer\\\\n    role: excluded\\\\n    priority: 10\\\\n    report_kinds: [B, C]\\\\n    design_categories: [healthy_volunteer]\\\\n    rationale_zh: 健康志愿者研究默认排除。\\\\n  - rule_id: exclude_pure_pk_or_be\\\\n    role: excluded\\\\n    priority: 10\\\\n    report_kinds: [B, C]\\\\n    design_categories: [pure_pk_or_be]\\\\n    rationale_zh: 纯 PK 或生物等效性研究默认排除。\\\\n  - rule_id: exclude_unrelated_indication\\\\n    role: excluded\\\\n    priority: 10\\\\n    report_kinds: [B, C]\\\\n    indicati