C, `全景台`, `证据室`, `设计图谱`, dual-mode entry, manual-trigger automatic refresh, HTML-runtime-only, immutable history, automatic diffs, independent clean-context review, R0, R1, fuzzy/LLM-assisted similarity matching\n   570\t\n   571\t## Task 2: Repair Report B scientific semantic view and preserve the lossless-pause boundary, outcome: recovery binding was previously repaired; P3 semantic/view fixes remain incomplete because independent review, gate, integration, and browser verification were interrupted\n   572\t\n   573\t### rollout_summary_files\n   574\t\n   575\t- rollout_summaries/2026-09-05T13-37-24-dswi-competitive_intelligence_p3_semantic_view_lossless_pause.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products/competitive-intelligence-workflow, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/sessions/2026/09/05/rollout-2026-09-05T21-37-24-01a071c9-c6b5-7ff3-a15a-22fab2fb278a.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-08T01:33:18+00:00, thread_id=01a071c9-c6b5-7ff3-a15a-22fab2fb278a, current P3 semantic-view pause boundary)\n   576\t\n   577\t### keywords\n   578\t\n   579\t- report-b, `semantic_grouping.py`, `report_b.py`, SemanticGroupingProposal, semantic_row_digest, `scientific_group_id`, `within_trial_longitudinal`, `_dedupe_records`, complete-link, `PAUSE_HANDOFF_20260908_093147.md`, `bb27ec9d`, WebKit, `28/277`, gate, integration, browser\n   580\t\n   581\t## Task 3: Rebaseline the multi-Skill workflow and pause the optional Yaozh browser route, outcome: deterministic quality gates passed but receipt consumption, executable source lineage, freshness policy, and real-host smoke remain incomplete\n   582\t\n   583\t### rollout_summary_files\n   584\t\n   585\t- rollout_summaries/2026-08-09T08-58-28-UfXz-competitive_intelligence_workflow_r25_yaozh_lossless_pause.md (cwd=/Users/smkzw/Documents/AI Products/竞品调研工作流, rollout_path=/Users/smkzw/.codex/sessions/2026/08/09/rollout-2026-08-09T16-58-28-019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-05T13:35:39+00:00, thread_id=019fe5be-b687-7e11-8c76-2b2c0d2126c9, R2.5 lossless pause; implementation checkout differs)\n   586\t\n   587\t### keywords\n   588\t\n   589\t- R2.5, Yaozh, `YaozhSessionObservation`, `YaozhRouteAccessReceipt`, `commercial_database`, `login_browser`, `designated_industry_source`, receipt consumer, freshness, 947 tests, `in_progress`\n   590\t\n   591\t## User preferences\n   592\t\n   593\t- when designing structured report output, the user rejected CSV/XLSX download-oriented tables: use HTML pages with adapted charts and complete tables hidden by default and expandable on click; preserve three independently designed A/B/C portals while sharing fonts, accessibility, responsiveness, and source conventions. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   594\t- when no/insufficient data is found, the user required a third-party-style diagnostic for missed search terms, search-rule errors, or network/data retrieval issues before using a brief explanation or omitting a field; do not fill pages with large empty fields. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   595\t- when B-class trials differ in wording, endpoints, or populations, use fuzzy/LLM-assisted substantial-similarity matching and lightly annotate small timepoint differences instead of forcing every variation into a separate display. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   596\t- when cross-trial comparison is requested, the user requires clinical semantics rather than exact strings or numerically close values: unknown is not the same, and a hard conflict cannot be overridden by a model. The real HTML must use the same scientific view; an internal helper passing while the portal uses the old glossary is not completion. [Task 2]\n   597\t- for all visible text, labels, and states, the user requires native Chinese clinical-trial language and acceptance from a “懒惰、视觉敏感、非技术背景的资深临床试验医学人员” perspective: inspect real interaction, hierarchy, complete tables, source drawers, and responsive behavior. [Task 2]\n   598\t- when the user says an optional Yaozh route must not block core research or retain credentials/Cookies/profile -> keep it nonblocking, minimally receipted, and distinguish a persisted receipt from a runnable capability. [Task 3]\n   599\t\n   600\t## Reusable knowledge\n   601\t\n   602\t- v1 framing: one public entry with testable sub-skills; existing `competitive-intelligence-workflow` skill is historical/audit input rather than current authority. The three portal positions are `全景台`, `证据室`, and `设计图谱`; the observed first-version exclusions were PDF/PPT export, spreadsheet export, radar charts, evidence-maturity views, and scheduled monitoring. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   603\t- Separate “few competitors but sufficient decision value” from an apparently under-collected landscape. For key missing data, use independent clean-context review, two recovery rounds plus final review; for competitor-universe completeness, require source convergence plus independent review. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   604\t- Publication handling allows login-dependent source access without credential collection and manual supplement files. Block when a known primary or required extension/long-term publication is unavailable; after explicit one-time confirmation, continuation can be graded rather than silently substituting evidence. Validation targets immune-mediated indications including PNH and IgAN, with large indications for collection completeness and smaller indications for detailed key-trial handling. [Task 1] [skysight memory]\n   605\t- Recovery must collect outputs from the current `format` node’s explicit `site_relative_path` and `manifest_relative_path`, then validate locked site/manifest plus project, contract, report identity, and snapshot chain. A legacy node lacking those bindings fails closed and preserves historical artifacts. The repaired paths passed `722` integration tests, 11 recovery tests, 42 bounded-review tests, Ruff, strict mypy, and the reported gate suites. [Task 2]\n   606\t- `SemanticGroupingProposal` and `semantic_row_digest` bind a proposal to the full observation digest; source changes invalidate it. Use pairwise compatible complete-link buckets to prevent transitive merging; unknown/uncovered observations remain descriptive and are not dropped. A complete clinical unit includes disease/severity, background therapy, population, endpoint/event definition, scale/direction, estimand, denominator, analysis set, statistical form, and actual time window. [Task 2]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"agent_message","text":"## 结论：rejected\n\n## K 五项复查（逐项）\n\n1. **背景药同义词清理：未完全闭合。** 六个原始问题词已不再形成产品实体，但 `rabbit atg`、`lapine t-lymphocyte immune globulin`、`muromonab` 等变体仍进入宇宙。\n2. **SB12 生物类似药误伤：已闭合。** `sb12` 已恢复，NCT04058158 及其结果均归入 `sb12`。\n3. **剂量/频次变体：已闭合。** `NTQ5082 100mg qd`、`200mg qd`、`200 mg` 均归入 `ntq5082`。\n4. **`soliris/ultomiris` 复合名：名称层面已闭合。** 未见复合字符串独立成产品；NCT07413250 在 sidecar 中归入代表性规范名 `eculizumab`。\n5. **`Part1/Part2: TUL321` 前缀：已闭合。** 当前产品为干净的 `tul321`。\n\n## 新可修复错误\n\n1. **背景/移植预处理变体残留：** `rabbit atg`（NCT06412497）、`lapine t-lymphocyte immune globulin`（NCT04965597）和 `muromonab`（NCT00566696）仍被建成产品。\n2. **结果错归属：** NCT00566696 的 EFS、OS、DFS 及严重不良事件（`eff-175`–`eff-177`、`safe-60`）归入 `muromonab`，但原登记描述的是多药移植预处理/移植物处理方案，不能形成 muromonab 的药物特异性结果。\n3. **别名未归并：** `ach-0144471` 与 `danicopan` 未合并；NCT03053102 将 ACH-0144471 列为 Danicopan 别名，且 NCT03181633 的安全性结果术语直接为 Danicopan。\n4. **规范身份未归一：** `humanized anti-factor bb monoclonal antibody` 未归入同一记录标题及别名明确的 `SAR443809`；`OMS906` 与同记录别名 `zaltenibart` 也未按 alias-map 的规范名规则统一。\n5. **黑名单误伤风险仍在：** NCT03866681 的 `sirolimus`、NCT01642979/NCT01760096 的 Levamisole 联合方案因粗粒度字符串规则整体排除；这些明确涉及 PNH 治疗的再定位/边界方案至少应有独立纳排审查，不能静默丢弃。\n\n## 裁决理由（按 K 框架）\n\n当前载荷数量和结构核对通过：46 产品、134 试验、234 疗效、80 安全、55 申办关系；sidecar 为 5 条样本量缺失、50 条无独立药物、139 组联合组合。\n\n但上述问题属于可由当前官方登记材料和载荷确定修复的实体分类、别名归并、误伤及结果关联错误，不是 G11-1 联合关系限制、中国路线 `access_blocked`、CT.gov 当前快照无历史宇宙或 G12-1 黑名单分类器演进可以豁免的已披露限制。\n\n应先补充结构化干预角色/创新边界分类，扩展别名映射，移除 NCT00566696 的错误产品级结果关联，重新生成载荷、sidecar 和审计包，再进行独立终审。\n\n## 观察意见（原样进入 scientific_review.observations，中文，≤5 条）\n\n1. R17 已闭合 SB12 恢复、NTQ5082 剂量归并及 TUL321 前缀清理；当前载荷结构计数核对通过。\n2. `rabbit atg`、`lapine t-lymphocyte immune globulin` 和 `muromonab` 仍属于移植预处理或背景干预污染。\n3. NCT00566696 的移植结果仍被错误投影为 muromonab 产品结果。\n4. `ach-0144471`、`SAR443809` 泛称及 `OMS906/zaltenibart` 的身份规范化仍未完成。\n5. G11-1、G7-2、中国路线访问受阻及当前快照限制可以披露，但不能豁免本轮已确认的实体分类、别名和结果关联错误。\n\n"}}
